## KEY PATTERNS DISCOVERED (from 93 cases)

### Structural Position Base Rates — WHERE you play matters more than HOW

| Position | Success Rate | Failure Rate | n | Verdict |
|----------|-------------|-------------|---|---------|
| **Data Intelligence** | **100%** | 0% | 5 | Best position |
| **Infrastructure** | **66%** | 28% | 32 | Strong |
| **Intermediary** | **62%** | 8% | 13 | Low failure |
| **Supply Chain** | 29% | 57% | 7 | Risky |
| **Crowd** | **25%** | **53%** | 36 | Worst — avoid |

### Compound Engine Base Rates — WHAT compounds matters

| Engine | Success Rate | Failure Rate | n |
|--------|-------------|-------------|---|
| **Reputation** | **100%** | 0% | 4 |
| **Distribution** | **62%** | 31% | 16 |
| **Audience** | **58%** | 25% | 12 |
| **Data** | **54%** | 15% | 13 |
| **Code** | 39% | **48%** | 31 |
| **None** | 29% | **47%** | 17 |

### Cross-Pattern Discoveries — The KILLER combos

| Combo | Success | n | Insight |
|-------|---------|---|---------|
| **data_intelligence × data** | **100%** | 5 | Best combo in dataset |
| **infrastructure × audience** | **100%** | 3 | Platform + followers = win |
| **intermediary × audience** | **100%** | 3 | Broker + audience = win |
| infrastructure × distribution | 75% | 8 | Strong |
| infrastructure × code | 67% | 18 | Typical SaaS path |
| **crowd × code** | **0%** | **9** | WORST COMBO — avoid |
| crowd × audience | 25% | 4 | Even audience can't save crowd |
| crowd × none | 36% | 11 | Death zone |

### CRITICAL INSIGHT: `crowd × code = 0% success rate (n=9)`

Đây là pattern QUAN TRỌNG NHẤT:
- 9 businesses thử build code product ở crowd position → 0 thành công
- Nghĩa là: xây SaaS/app để cạnh tranh trực tiếp với hàng trăm đối thủ = guaranteed fail
- Ngược lại: infrastructure × code = 67% (build tool CHO crowd, không CẠNH TRANH với crowd)

